1. **FSv2 Progression:** Sue Hares to publish version -09 and -10 of `draft-ietf-idr-fsv2-ip-basic` on GitHub, incorporating capability signaling and standard validation checks.
2. **Adoption Summaries:** Chairs to finalize and post working group adoption call results for the FSv2 filter/action candidates and core protocol candidates (`21-Core-Adoption-Add-Path-limits` and `22-Core-Adoption-OTC-RS-Verification`).
